==Description==
This is the core template (with [[Help:Extensions|variables]]) for linking song uploads.

==Parameters==

Example:

*{{t|LL|abbr|URL|Comment}}
*{{LL|yt|ARj92WMUoow|Official}}

If certain links disrupt the template then use:

*Question mark HTML <code>&#</code>63;
*Equal sign HTML <code>&#</code>61;

